<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts" xml:lang="zh-CN"><voice name="zh-CN-YunxiNeural"><bookmark mark="l0"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.8"><prosody rate="0%" pitch="0%">第二，<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">缩短</prosody>生产和运输的<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">提前期</prosody>，减少等货期间的反复猜测。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l0-end"/><break time="160ms"/><bookmark mark="l1"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.8"><prosody rate="-1%" pitch="+1%">第三，<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">在成本允许时</prosody>，<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">小批量、多批次</prosody>补货，不把好几天的需求挤成一张大单。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l1-end"/><break time="190ms"/><bookmark mark="l2"/><mstts:express-as style="serious" styledegree="0.45"><prosody rate="-1%" pitch="-1%">第四，稳定价格和促销节奏。<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">不是禁止促销</prosody>，而是<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">提前共享计划</prosody>，别让上游把囤货误当成<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">长期增长</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l2-end"/></voice></speak>